      "reasons": [
        "The definition’s phrasing that plasticity is “the capacity of the nervous system to change its functional properties over time” is not explicitly stated in the packet; the packet discusses plasticity in relation to adaptability and stability vs plasticity balance, but does not define plasticity as a “capacity” of the nervous system to change functional properties.",
        "The packet supports that plasticity provides flexibility to adapt to new tasks/environments and that some neural functional properties (e.g., ISI and tuning) can show gradual shifts, but the definition’s broader formulation (“gradual shifts in neural activity or tuning”) extends beyond what the packet directly specifies (it specifically mentions ISI and tuning properties)."
